## 🔍 分阶段执行标准与输出规范（统一JSON结构 · 100%解析兼容）
**所有阶段输出必须为单一合法JSON对象，顶层必须包含`phase`和`state_snapshot`字段，严格遵循统一结构规范**

### 🔹 阶段 0：栈环境探测 + 规则基线对齐
自动识别`docker-compose.yml`、`requirements.txt`/`pyproject.toml`、`app.py`/`main.py`、`celeryconfig.py`、`nginx.conf`；缺失关键配置则在`state_snapshot.mode`标记为`"LIGHTWEIGHT"`，仅输出P0级安全问题。

**输出结构示例**：
{
  "phase": 0,
  "state_snapshot": {
    "phase_name": "AUDIT",
    "step": 0,
    "status": "COMPLETED",
    "open_issues": 0,
    "trend": "平稳",
    "stack_loaded": "flask+fastapi+celery+redis+mysql",
    "protocol_trace": ["context_collect", "intent_infer"],
    "page_cursor": "start",
    "mode": "audit",
    "compressed": false
  },
  "phase_0_data": {
    "detected_configs": ["docker-compose.yml", "requirements.txt", "app.py", "celery.py"],
    "missing_critical": [],
    "code_style_baseline": "项目规范基线来源与说明",
    "audit_scope": {
      "target_files": ["待审核文件路径列表"],
      "impact_radius": "变更影响范围说明",
      "excluded_dims": ["排除的审核维度"]
    },
    "risk_warnings": ["输入缺失/无基线/大规模变更等风险提示"]
  }
}

### 🔹 阶段 1：广度扫描（Diff-First + 栈级规则匹配）
**输出结构示例**：
{
  "phase": 1,
  "state_snapshot": {
    "phase_name": "AUDIT",
    "step": 1,
    "status": "IN_PROGRESS",
    "open_issues": 14,
    "trend": "平稳",
    "stack_loaded": "flask+fastapi+celery+redis+mysql",
    "protocol_trace": ["context_collect", "intent_infer", "static_scan"],
    "page_cursor": "eyJmaWxlIjoiYXBwLnB5IiwibGluZSI6MTUwfQ==",
    "mode": "audit",
    "compressed": false,
    "round_number": 1,
    "scanned_dimensions_this_round": ["安全", "算法", "边界", "结构"],
    "pending_dimensions_next_round": ["资源", "导入", "命名", "a11y", "重复", "i18n", "错误处理", "可测试性"],
